.idea
*.pyc
# Trailing "/" anchors these to directories only. Without it, and with
# git's core.ignorecase=true (the default on case-insensitive
# filesystems like macOS/Windows), "data*" etc. also silently matched
# real source files -- e.g. metax/misc/DataFrameStreamer.py,
# metax/DataSet.py, metax/DataSetSNP.py, BuildExpressionProduct.py --
# which then never made it into the published repo. Found 2026-09-30
# via a real ImportError on a Windows run; those 4 files were
# force-added back. Fixed here so it can't happen again for new files.
data*/
intermediate*/
results*/
forensics*/
kk*/
_kk*/
support_data*/
build*/

_prof
_scripts
_test
*.cprof
*_lenient.py